    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "This time tomorrow, four brave astronauts on Artemis II will be en route to orbit the moon. Their mission could take them farther from earth than anyone\u2019s been before.\u00a0\n\nWe will wait and watch, and celebrate the work of so many to reach so far.\u00a0\n\nGodspeed!\n\nOP: astro.alexandra (via IG)\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2039174408607289701",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-01T02:53:59+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The Power of Kindness\n\nOP: kiergaines\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2039151008891220177",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-01T01:21:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Trump\u2019s corruption and grift is unprecedented.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2039101109155844529",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-31T22:02:43+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Facts!\n\nOP: rebmasel (via IG)\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2039018248709026120",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-31T16:33:28+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Donald Trump's immigration outrages are hurting Americans and diminishing our strength.\n\nOP: @harryjsisson via IG\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2038988393758019995",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-31T14:34:50+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The power of kindness.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2038948830431850604",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-31T11:57:37+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "This is beautiful.\u00a0\nBe intentional with kindness\u00a0\nMake connections\nMotivate, Elevate and Celebrate.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2038783545158611272",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-31T01:00:50+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Thank you Leigh McGowan for laying it plain (@iampoliticsgirl via IG)\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2038760415966937506",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-30T23:28:56+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Republicans in Congress are refusing any level of accountability, oversight, and checks and balances for the corruption of the Trump administration.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2038741067147731070",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-30T22:12:03+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Trump and Vance think fraudsters and people who assault police should walk free. \n\nOP: lawyer_oyer via IG\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2038695751392367022",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-30T19:11:58+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "When the system feels rigged and the odds feel impossible, one person who refuses to give up can matter more than they know.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2038646443997618558",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-30T15:56:03+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "My Monday Morning Mantra\n\nHave a great week - despite it all.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2038589674692714941",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-30T12:10:28+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The True dwelling of the holy.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2038422501932298412",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-30T01:06:11+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I will not vote for one more dollar for this reckless and out of control agency. Congress must do its job and hold them to account.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2038397497157079055",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-29T23:26:49+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We are not alone in this fight. Thank you Atlanta for standing with me!\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2038380414625022320",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-29T22:18:56+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Trump continues to oversee price increases with no end in sight.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2038363193081225367",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-29T21:10:30+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The SAVE Act will disenfranchise Americans across the country. We must protect the right to vote.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2038326825659605319",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-29T18:46:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The brave men and women who serve our nation deserve to be led by people who know what they are doing.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2038280514004455793",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-29T15:41:58+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "cory-booker",
      "voiceName": "Cory Booker",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Kindness\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/CoryBooker/status/2038225632983757203",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-29T12:03:53+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    }
  ],
